    "long_instructions": "####Write a button that tells visitors what to do next\r\n\r\n1. Look at the button on your page.\r\n2. Think about the most important thing a visitor should do next.\r\n3. Write a new label for the button that starts with an action word. For example, “View Gallery” or “Join the Club.”\r\n4. Tell the AI to change the button text to your new label.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Change the button text to ‘Join the Club.’”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it include the exact words for your new button label?",
